  m_Name: "Sen Ne anlars\u0131n"
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  npcText: "Sen kimle konu\u015Ftu\u011Funu bilir misin ye\u011Fen, ben koskoca Ahmet
    Demir ! Benim onaramad\u0131\u011F\u0131m z\u0131mb\u0131rt\u0131 yoktur bu \xFClkede."
  textA: "Size g\xFCvenmedim, l\xFCtfen buray\u0131 terk edin."
  nextNodeA: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f5d995eb23a1ae489bf987257dc680b, type: 2}
  textB: "Teknik i\u015Fleden anl\u0131yor musun ?"
